      ) /\ -. ( ( R - P ) / ( Q - P ) ) e. RR ) -> ( ( Q =/= S /\ ( ( R - S ) / ( Q - S ) ) e. RR /\
      ( ( R - S ) / ( Q - S ) ) < 0 ) -> ( ( ( -. P = Q /\ -. Q = S ) /\ -. P = S ) /\ -. ( ( S - P
      ) / ( Q - P ) ) e. RR ) ) ) ) ) ) )
