      R ) /\ -. P = R ) /\ -. ( ( R - P ) / ( Q - P ) ) e. RR ) ) /\ ( Q =/= S /\ ( ( R - S ) / ( Q
      - S ) ) e. RR /\ ( ( R - S ) / ( Q - S ) ) < 0 ) ) -> ( ( ( P e. CC /\ Q e. CC ) /\ R e. CC )
